This is a known problem with the framed package. I begin to feel
annoyed by this package now since several people reported it. I do
have some solutions, but they look messy. I'm trying to come up with a
cleaner solution.

At the moment, you can disable the framed package completely by:

knit_hooks$set(chunk = function(x, options) x)

